### Test 1: Lihat semua device
GET http://localhost:3000/api/devices

### Test 2: Tambah AP baru
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "AP Test 3",
  "ip_address": "1.2.3.4"
  
}

### Test 3: Ubah AP )
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/devices/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "AP Test 3 (Updated)"
}

### Test 4: Hapus AP 
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/devices/3

### Test 5: Validasi IP salah (harus gagal dengan pesan jelas, bukan error 500)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "AP Salah",
  "ip_address": "abc"
}

### Test 6: Cek summary
GET http://localhost:3000/api/summary

### Test 7: Cek logs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/logs